      "writtenOn": "2026-10-23T23:01:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "linkfile() only sees links into a named attribute directory. LINK calls the\nobj_ops of the source object, so a link of a named attribute goes to\nnamed_attr_link() in namedattr.c, which returns NFS4ERR_XDEV. I\u0027ve added a\ncomment in linkfile() explaining this.",
